      "message": "Yes, but this does not call other functions, so I think it\u0027s fine?\n\nI looked for examples generated by the compiler, and, for example, memcpy_from_usbram does the exact same thing (push these 5 registers onto the stack, but it does not need to align on 64-bit as it does not call subfunctions).",
